Z||000000||Fret Naught||10-07-2000||01:13 AM||||Well I guess it is my turn, came out from having dinner with my wife tonight at the Olive Garden, and found this, <BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/P1010007.JPG"> <BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/P1010008.JPG"> <BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/P1010009.JPG"> <BR>There was a business card on the window, I tried calling but got an answering machine. It looks like the door frame is tweaked pretty good, what do you guys think? Any body and fender boys your advice is needed about now.<BR>Thanks<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/FretNaught_sig_7.gif"> ||||reg||8
Z||000001||mrfiero||10-07-2000||02:17 AM||||At the very least you will need a new door & mirror......was the door skin damaged? If it was add that to the tally.  It looks like you have a nice aftermarket paint job there.....it may be difficult to match the paint, if the skin needs replacing.<P>You may have some frame damage at the hinge area, but I can't tell from the photos.  <P>Did you call the police?  Even though he left a card I would have filed a report.  It could be someone elses card or ??  and you could get screwed.<P>Good luck and LMK if you need an estimate for these parts (I'll write you up a nice one).   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif">   <P>||||reg||1
Z||000002||Fret Naught||10-07-2000||02:52 AM||||No, I didn't call the police, it was dark, cars everywhere, you know I am always harping at my kids if you get in a wreck call the police no matter what, and I didn't. Go figure, I guess I thought well the only coverage I have is liability so my insurance won't cover it anyway? the door skin looks like it is undamaged, and I just happen to have the paint codes and about a pint of paint left. The door is rubbing pretty good when it opens and closes so I figure there will be some hinge damage, man I hope this guy will be stand up. He did leave his card with a note that said I hit your mirror. I probably could use a parts estimate, just so I have some idea when I do get hold of him. Thanks<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/FretNaught_sig_8.gif"> ||||reg||9
Z||000003||Fret Naught||10-07-2000||11:01 AM||||Bummer, Just took a look at it in the day light, looks like there is a bit of a tear in the door skin, about 1/2 inch long, not sure that is a real big deal though.<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/FretNaught_sig_9.gif"> ||||reg||13
