Z||000005||count_iblis||10-07-2000||11:59 AM||||I love you leather interior also, I think the Fiero has the best leather interior of any car.  Once again sorry.<P>||||reg||1
Z||000006||contra||10-07-2000||01:03 PM||||looks like if you got a new door and mirror, you could do the work yourself without an insurance claim, so your premiums dont go up. Otherwise file a report and let the insurance company fix your car, and send him the bill.<BR>it could be almost $1000 <BR>hehe<BR>||||reg||1
Z||000007||theogre||10-07-2000||03:12 PM||||The door framing can be straightened. I had to do it to mine. It's a giant pain in the ____ but doable. <P>before you try it take off the skin on a good door or at least the mirror so you can see what it's suposed to look like. There's one spot by the front of the mirror that has an odd bend that doesn't look like it belongs but it has to be like that or the mirror won't sit right.<P>The mirror is obvoiusly trash.<P>If the skin is cracked, and I expect it is at least by the miror there are a number of epoxies that can be used to fix it. If you pick a clear one then you may not even see it once it's glued. Depends how close you look and how careful you did the job.<p>[This message has been edited by theogre (edited 10-07-2000).]||||reg||1
Z||000008||fldevel||10-07-2000||05:40 PM||||argh ... that person deserves to be beaten to a bloody pulp ..that poor car ..well maybe some of you guys in WA can straiten him out ... i think thats whare it sed you where from .. ||||reg||1
Z||000009||fropuff||10-07-2000||06:16 PM||||That's too bad about your car.  At least they didn't drive off like some people would.  I agree with Contra.  Get it fixed, then send them the bill.  It can't be too much if it's just the fender, mirror, and door skin.  You said the door skin wasn't a big deal, but I would get everything done at the same time.  Did you call the person yet?||||reg||1
Z||000010||Coconut||10-07-2000||06:47 PM||||Gawd, that hurts to see your blue beauty violated like that!  Fret Naught, I don't know if you've resolved your predicament with this careless perpetrator, but if you need another door, I may have what you need. I just have to double check to see if it is in fact a driver's side door. If you absolutely need it, I'll give it to you for free. E-mail me if I can be of any assistance bud.<P>Cruisin' On, <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>------------------<BR>   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Coconut's_Signature_1.JPG"> ||||reg||8
