Z||000012||Fret Naught||10-07-2000||09:03 PM||||Thanks, You folks are the tops, and Coconut, I sure appreciate the offer, I don't know what shape the door is in yet, other than it is bent. I called the number on the card again today and got the machine again, it is the guys business card, so I don't expect to get hold of him until monday. I want to see what he says, how he wants to handle it etc... before I start tearing into it. He might say "hey go get a couple of estimates and send me copies and I will cut you a check"  that of course would be great. I just got to wait now.<BR><P>------------------<BR>||||reg||14
